class.description:
[TamaServerBullet] is a thin proxy object that represents one active bullet managed by the server bullet pool. It is passed as the first argument of the [signal TamaManager.bullet_hit] signal whenever a server bullet's collision area overlaps a physics body.

Use [method TamaManager.destroy_server_bullet] to remove the bullet when handling a hit:
[codeblock]
func _ready():
    TamaManager.bullet_hit.connect(_on_bullet_hit)

func _on_bullet_hit(bullet: TamaServerBullet, body_instance_id: int) -> void:
    if body_instance_id == get_instance_id():
        TamaManager.destroy_server_bullet(bullet)
[/codeblock]

[b]Note:[/b] Do not store [TamaServerBullet] references across frames. The underlying slot may be recycled and reused at any time once the bullet is no longer active.
